msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "CamSpy\n"

#. "L_EAR_092"
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Une CamSpy\n"

#. "L_EAR_093"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "CamSpy obtenue.\n"

#. "L_EAR_094"
msgid ""
"That's the highest security sector - Dr. Caroll \n"
"has got to be nearby.\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est le secteur le plus protégé - Le Dr. Caroll \n"
"doit s'y trouver.\n"

#. "L_EAR_095"
msgid "Something around here's using a lot of power.\n"
msgstr "Quelque chose dans les environs consomme beaucoup d'énergie.\n"

#. "L_EAR_096"
msgid ""
"Reprogram that cleaning bot - \n"
"it'll give you a way in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Reprogrammez ce robot de nettoyage - \n"
"il vous fera entrer.\n"

#. "L_EAR_097"
msgid ""
"Get out, Jo! The levels are too high. \n"
"Use the CamSpy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sortez, Joanna! La radioactivité est élevée. \n"
"Utilisez la CamSpy.\n"

#. "L_EAR_098"
msgid "Secret weapons compartment opened.\n"
msgstr "Compartiment armes secrètes ouvert.\n"

#. "L_EAR_099"
msgid "Enemy detected - weapon cache locked.\n"
msgstr "Ennemi détecté - coffre d'armes fermé.\n"

#. "L_EAR_100"
msgid "Dr. Caroll?\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll?\n"

#. "L_EAR_101"
msgid "Dr. Caroll, are you here?\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll, êtes-vous ici?\n"

#. "L_EAR_102"
msgid "Well, is it safe to come out?\n"
msgstr "Tout...tout danger est écarté?\n"

#. "L_EAR_103"
msgid "Yes, all clear.\n"
msgstr "Oui. Tout va bien.\n"

#. "L_EAR_104"
msgid "Wh..what... you're...\n"
msgstr "M...Mais... vous...\n"

#. "L_EAR_105"
msgid ""
"Very professionally done, my dear, but there's \n"
"no time to waste! We must leave immediately!\n"
msgstr ""
"Belle manoeuvre, mon enfant. Il n'y a pas de\n"
"temps à perdre. Nous devons partir!\n"

#. "L_EAR_106"
msgid ""
"Come on. I have vital information, and you \n"
"must protect me.\n"
msgstr ""
"Allons. J'ai des informations vitales à \n"
"révéler et vous devez me protéger.\n"
